OL,3,GNEWSASergeant who made racist comment
OL,4,Asacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police sergeant who made a racist
OL,7,Fcomment while working in a police
OL,8,Fcustody suite has been dismissed.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said it held a
OL,11,Fgross misconduct hearing at its
OL,12,FSherwood Lodge headquarters on
OL,13,FWednesday in relation to an incident at
OL,14,Fa custody suite on 19 November last
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
