OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1788384333
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSASergeant who made racist comment
OL,4,Asacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British Asian man was being
OL,7,Ftransferred from the custody suite when
OL,8,Fthe officer made comments that were
OL,9,F"discriminatory, offensive, and
OL,10,Finappropriate", including telling the
OL,11,Fman: "Come on, get back on the boat and
OL,12,Fgo back to where you come from".
OL,14,FThe officer, whose name the force is
OL,15,Fnot releasing "on medical grounds", has
OL,16,Falso been placed on the barred list,
OL,17,Fmeaning they cannot serve as a police
OL,18,Fofficer again.
